  "title": "Lantern Courtyard",
  "rules": [
    "Two wardens pursue two pennant-carrying couriers around a central wall.",
    "Tagging an adjacent unprotected courier freezes them and drops their pennant.",
    "An adjacent teammate can rescue a frozen courier, granting temporary protection.",
    "Couriers must spend finite shelter charges for cover; wardens can seal shelters.",
    "Couriers share radio positions. Opponents and loose pennants are sensed only nearby.",
    "An escaped courier cannot return to rescue. The chase ends when both escape or every remaining courier is frozen."
  ],
